+## smallpt (WebAssembly path tracer)
+
+The home page renders a scene client-side with [smallpt](http://www.kevinbeason.com/smallpt/) compiled to WebAssembly.
+
+- `wasm/smallpt.cpp` — smallpt's original renderer plus a small exported C API (progressive passes, settable sphere colors)
+- `wasm/build.sh` — rebuilds `public/wasm/smallpt.{mjs,wasm}` with Emscripten (`em++` on `PATH`); the output is committed, so the site build doesn't need Emscripten
+- `public/wasm/smallpt-worker.js` — runs the module in a Web Worker
+- `src/components/SmallptRender.astro` — canvas + "Re-render with random colors" button
